ng, so files matched by a .gitattributes in the deployment\nfolder are pushed as LFS objects instead of failing GitHub's 100MB\npre-receive check. Takes over #1970 (Copilot), rebased onto current dev\nand closes two gaps found in review:\n\n- git lfs install failures now fail the deploy loudly instead of\n  silently continuing, since a silent failure just means large files\n  get committed as regular blobs and fail confusingly later at push\n  time instead of failing here with a clear cause.\n- git lfs install --local writes to the shared repo config, not\n  anything worktree-local, so it now gets undone in the post-deploy\n  cleanup to avoid leaking LFS hooks/filters into the rest of the job.", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T15:20:58Z", "author": {"name": "Jives", "email": "iam@jamesiv.es"}, "committer": {"name": "Jives", "email": "iam@jamesiv.es"}}, "repository": {"id": 173468816, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNzM0Njg4MTY=", "name": "github-pages-deploy-action", "full_name": "JamesIves/github-pages-deploy-action", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "JamesIves", "id": 10888441, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwODg4NDQx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10888441?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves", "html_url": "https://github.com/JamesIves", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JamesIves/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_